2026-08-25T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-1033) 'Geometric algorithms get their own list, apart from the neural models.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD1033  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-1033) 'The catalog mixes deep learning models and geometric algorithms. A reader who plans memory cannot tell the two apart.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD1033  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-1033) 'Check a new entry against the rule above: an algorithm that holds no weights goes in the algorithm table below, and a neural model goes in RFD66606-1016.
 # tags: rfd:exit
